purpose:
To seek to approve the
following suppliers on the Open Framework for
the Provision of Transportation of Children, Young People and
Adults (Up to 8 Passenger seat Vehicles):
 
Red Cab Taxis Ltd T/A C
Cabs;
Blackpool Taxis Ltd;
Blacktax Radio Taxis
Ltd;
Brown Cabs;
Premier Cabs;
 
following the completion of an
open tendering exercise.

content:
To seek to approve the
following suppliers on the Open Framework for
the Provision of Transportation of Children, Young People and
Adults (Up to 8 Passenger seat Vehicles):
 
Red Cab Taxis Ltd T/A C
Cabs;
Blackpool Taxis Ltd;
Blacktax Radio Taxis
Ltd;
Brown Cabs;
Premier Cabs;
 
following the completion of an
open tendering exercise.
 

To approve:
 
Red Cab Taxis Ltd T/A C
Cabs;
Blackpool Taxis Ltd;
Blacktax Radio Taxis
Ltd;
Brown Cabs;
Premier Cabs;
 
As suppliers on an Open
Framework for the Provision of Transportation of Children, Young
People and Adults (Up to 8 Passenger seat Vehicles).
